            <ArticleTitle>Laparoscopic treatment of an isolated gallbladder rupture following blunt abdominal trauma in a schoolboy rugby player.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>378-9; discussion 379</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Laparoscopic treatment of an isolated gallbladder rupture in a schoolboy rugby player resulting from blunt abdominal trauma has not previously been reported. A case report of this rare occurrence is presented together with a brief review of the literature.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
